# Signing — never commit these
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# ...except the debug keystore, which is deliberately committed so CI-built
# APKs are signed with a stable key and can be installed over each other.
# Debug keystores are non-secret by design. See docs/DECISIONS.md D-013.
!debug.keystore

